      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yahova Yalaga Vovoholore",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteeve Yahova imbura mu ing'inga yu kutaga mu muhiga. Yahova atumaa malesi gimbula kandi agikubiza, ma emeliza milimi ku vuli mundu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vandu vateva vifananyi vivavuuliri, navuzwa mativuli ga vanyoola gaveeye go vovehi kandi gavuzwa. Valala vivalaa maloto cha gavoora, navuzwa vamugotizaa; vweremerizi vwa vamuheza voveeye vwa vuzwa. Kunangwa vandu vagendagenda kuli magondi gagota. Vaveeye mu vudinyu kigira sivaveeye nu mwimiliri mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova avoora, “Mbeeye nu vutima na vageni vamiiha vandu vange kandi nziza kuvaha mageri. Avandu vi Ivuyuda vaveeye vandu vange, kandi inzi Yahova Wuvunyali ndakavalindi. Valakave kuli zibarasi ziange zie liihi zie zinguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avamihi aviimiliri, na vahaani va malago, valakatuli muvo; avalakamiihi avandu vange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vi Ivuyuda valakaguuti kuli vasikari vaduvagira vasigu vaavo mu madohi gizinzira. Valakalwaane kigira Yahova aveeye harara navo, kandi valakaguuti kali avasigu valiva ku zibarasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
